/*
 * NFC Tag Keychain & UV Printer Jig Batch Generator
 *
 * Merged Updates:
 * - Per-Tag Thickness: Each tag can now specify its absolute total thickness in mm.
 * - Dynamic Jig Depth: The jig automatically calculates independent pocket depths per tag.
 * - Added Custom SVG shape support natively into the batch array.
 * - FIXED SVG RENDER BUG: OpenSCAD drops strings inside list comprehensions during import. SVGs are now hard-mapped back to global variables.
 * - Layered-bevel logic bypasses Minkowski timeouts for complex vectors (zero-radius CGAL crash prevented).
 * - Per-Tag NFC Configuration: Recess properties (size, offset, depth) are now managed individually per tag.
 */

